  "description": "Find the area of the largest square containing only 1s in a binary matrix.",
  "target": 4,
  "pseudocode": "1. dp = Array(rows + 1, cols + 1).fill(0)\n2. maxSide = 0\n3. for i from 1 to rows:\n4.   for j from 1 to cols:\n5.     if matrix[i-1][j-1] == '1':\n6.       dp[i][j] = min(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1], dp[i-1][j-1]) + 1\n7.       maxSide = max(maxSide, dp[i][j])\n8. return maxSide * maxSide",
